Cell["The transformation law and the Galilean limit", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"baf866c1-d91c-4e6b-9491-86d342246cf7"],

Cell["\<\
These are the same formulas stated in the paper: gamma controls the boost \
family, time-space mixing is scaled by kappa, and the Galilean case appears \
as the exact kappa -> 0 limit.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2f700287-51dc-4272-a5d9-cdd1082669a5"],

