Cell["\<\
That boost block scaling is the local computational shadow of \
`boostCommutator_scales_with_kappa` in `OnePostulate/KinematicAlgebra.lean`.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4c81627a-10e5-418b-9886-50485fa02ad0"],

Cell["Computing the Killing form", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"2e953db0-a25e-4052-80df-af643c2fc5d9"],

