Cell["Why the Killing form decides the geometry", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"41bb35e6-4a03-42ac-984a-b2042ba49ff2"],

Cell["\<\
Once the Killing form is diagonalized, the sign and degeneracy of the boost \
block become a structural test. At kappa = 0 the form goes blind on boosts; \
away from zero it sees them.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d786f0f1-a4e7-4724-a34d-505dd010ada3"],

