Cell["How this connects to the Lean proof", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"517265a4-2860-4fa3-bbfc-36ab3a24b8a1"],

Cell["\<\
The crosswalk is intentionally concise. Wolfram computes exact expressions \
and visuals; Lean remains the proof authority for bracket identities, \
invariant forms, and branch-selection statements.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d0f87087-52e6-40af-8b6b-3a12df099afc"],

